From: R. David Lankes  <rdlankes@mailbox.syr.edu> 
 
Subject: Multimedia Educational Authoring System (MEAS1) 
 
Current multimedia tools lack any sort of guidance or 
educational slants. What MEAS seeks to do, is provide the ease 
of use and generality of an authoring tool, but with specific 
support for the purpose of education.  The Multimedia Consortium 
is dedicated to the research of distributed multimedia systems. 
It is founded on three basic tenants: application of scientific 
research in 'real-world' problems; exploration of cutting edge 
technology, and development of new and innovative uses for  
mainstream technology; and a special consideration of special 
populations, such as the physically disadvantaged. 
 
